.Dd June 9, 2026
.Dt ZDOTS-GH 1
.Os zdots
.Sh NAME
.Nm zdots-gh
.Nd GitHub org/user delivery-health and process-forensics insights
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar command
.Op Ar owner
.Op Ar options
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
harvests GitHub organization or user metadata into a local DuckDB warehouse and
renders delivery-health and forensic process-inference reports for the zdots
knowledge base. It is local-first: the authenticated GitHub API
.Pq via Xr gh 1
is the only network egress; analysis runs in DuckDB and reports render with Ruby
and Python. No cloud LLM is involved.
.Pp
An
.Ar owner
is a GitHub organization
.Em or
user login
.Pq Ic gh repo list Ar owner No covers both .
The pipeline runs in four stages, each available as its own subcommand and
chained by
.Ic run :
.Bl -enum -compact -offset indent
.It
.Ic harvest
\(em fetch PR/issue metadata (GraphQL) and Actions, releases, and repository
metadata (REST) into a per-repo JSON cache (incremental; skips fresh files).
.It
.Ic warehouse
\(em build the per-owner DuckDB warehouse from the cache.
.It
.Ic report / Ic insights
\(em render Markdown reports (and an optional HTML dashboard) plus
coordination-graph edge-lists.
.It
.Ic ingest
\(em feed the Markdown reports into the knowledge base via
.Xr zdots-ctx 1 .
.El
.Pp
The
.Ic insights
report is forensic: it infers the
.Em observed
engineering process from GitHub behaviour \(em flow metrics, DORA-adjacent
proxies, change classification, actor and bus-factor analysis, repository
health, change-management archetypes, GitHub Actions reliability, releases,
issue triage, Conway/socio-technical coordination graphs, and a three-year
temporal comparison. Every metric carries a confidence tag
.Pq Em observed , inferred , proxy , No or Em unavailable
and is traceable to a source view; what GitHub cannot show is recorded under
.Dq Unknowns & Data Gaps ,
not hidden. Given a fixed
.Fl -as-of
reference date the report is deterministic.
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width warehouse
.It Ic harvest Ar owner
Fetch PR/issue + Actions/releases/repo metadata into the JSON cache
(incremental; use
.Fl -force
to refresh).
.It Ic warehouse Ar owner
(Re)build the per-owner DuckDB warehouse from the cache.
.It Ic report Ar owner Op Fl -html
Render the DORA/DevEx Markdown report, and the HTML dashboard with
.Fl -html .
.It Ic insights Ar owner Op Fl -as-of Ar date
Render the forensic process-inference report and coordination-graph edge-lists.
.It Ic ingest Ar owner
Ingest the Markdown report(s) into the knowledge base.
.It Ic run Ar owner Op Fl -html
Run the full pipeline: harvest \(-> warehouse \(-> report \(-> insights \(-> ingest.
.It Ic status Op Ar owner
Show cache, warehouse, report, and insights freshness for one or all owners.
.El
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Fl
.It Fl -force
Re-harvest even if cached JSON exists.
.It Fl -html
Also emit the rich HTML dashboard (for
.Ic report
and
.Ic run ) .
.It Fl -as-of Ar date
Reference date for
.Ic insights
.Pq Ar YYYY-MM-DD ; No default today .
Anchors open-item age and the 1/2/3-year temporal buckets, making the report
reproducible.
.It Fl -no-insights
For
.Ic run :
skip the forensic insights step.
.It Fl -no-ingest
For
.Ic run :
skip the knowledge-base ingest step.
.It Fl -dry-run
For
.Ic ingest :
show what would be ingested, change nothing.
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Show usage.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width ZDOTS_GH_INCLUDE_ARCHIVED
.It Ev ZDOTS_GH_STATE
Cache/warehouse/report root
.Pq default Pa $XDG_STATE_HOME/zdots/gh .
.It Ev ZDOTS_GH_REPO_LIMIT
Max repos to enumerate
.Pq default 100 .
.It Ev ZDOTS_GH_PR_PAGE
Pull requests fetched per GraphQL page
.Pq default 25 .
.It Ev ZDOTS_GH_ISSUE_PAGE
Issues fetched per GraphQL page
.Pq default 50 .
.It Ev ZDOTS_GH_INCLUDE_FORKS
Set to 1 to include forks
.Pq default 0 .
.It Ev ZDOTS_GH_INCLUDE_ARCHIVED
Set to 1 to include archived repos
.Pq default 0 .
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Pa
.It Pa $ZDOTS_GH_STATE/<owner>/*.json
Raw cache: PRs/issues (GraphQL) plus Actions, releases, and repo metadata (REST).
.It Pa $ZDOTS_GH_STATE/<owner>/graphs/*.json
Coordination-graph edge-lists exported by
.Ic insights .
.It Pa $ZDOTS_GH_STATE/<owner>.duckdb
Analytical warehouse.
.It Pa $ZDOTS_GH_STATE/reports/<owner>.md
Ingestable DORA/DevEx report.
.It Pa $ZDOTS_GH_STATE/reports/<owner>.insights.md
Forensic process-inference report.
.It Pa $ZDOTS_GH_STATE/reports/<owner>.html
Executive HTML dashboard
.Pq Fl -html .
.It Pa etc/zdots-gh/warehouse.sql
DuckDB schema and analytical views.
.It Pa etc/zdots-gh/insights-catalog.yaml
Metric registry: confidence class and source view per insight.
.It Pa etc/zdots-gh/insights.rb , Pa etc/zdots-gh/report.py
The insights and report renderers.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh EXAMPLES
Full pipeline with the HTML dashboard:
.Pp
.Dl zdots-gh run phalanxduel --html
.Pp
A reproducible forensic snapshot for a fixed reference date:
.Pp
.Dl zdots-gh insights phalanxduel --as-of 2026-06-09
.Pp
Refresh a user's cache from scratch:
.Pp
.Dl zdots-gh harvest just3ws --force
.Pp
Show freshness for every harvested owner:
.Pp
.Dl zdots-gh status
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr duckdb 1 ,
.Xr gh 1 ,
.Xr zdots-ctx 1 ,
.Xr zdots 7
